<title>ITALY: Cariplo, Ambroveneto decline comment on report.</title>
<headline>Cariplo, Ambroveneto decline comment on report.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian savings bank Cariplo and Banco Ambrosiano Veneto declined to comment on a newspaper report that they were planning a strategic link-up.</p>
<p>Officials at both banks said they had no comment on a report in Il Sole 24 Ore on Tuesday saying the Cariplo foundation, which owns the savings bank, intends to propose that Ambroveneto acquire a stake in Cariplo. --Milan newsroom +392-66102321</p>
</text>
